    # robin "What if he was able to find me and he's just-"
    robin "¿Qué pasaría si pudiera encontrarme y simplemente...?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1247
translate spanish story_beat4_fc2d0705:

    # pro "Hey, it's okay."
    pro "Oye, está bien."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1248
translate spanish story_beat4_09ee27bc:

    # pro "Even if it's him, I'll be here to protect you."
    pro "Incluso si es él, estaré aquí para protegerte."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1253
translate spanish story_beat4_4d08e9be:

    # robin "But what if he brings others with him?"
    robin "¿Pero qué pasa si trae a otros con él?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1258
translate spanish story_beat4_7446d679:

    # robin "Or tries to force himself into our apartment?"
    robin "¿O intenta entrar por la fuerza en nuestro apartamento?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1263
translate spanish story_beat4_306014b9:

    # pro "Hey, slow down Robin..."
    pro "Oye, más despacio Robin..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1264
translate spanish story_beat4_e883f529:

    # pro "I promise that won't happen."
    pro "Prometo que eso no sucederá."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1265
translate spanish story_beat4_aaf2df2d:

    # pro "They don't know you live here..."
    pro "No saben que vives aquí..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1266
translate spanish story_beat4_7a45b696:

    # pro "And I'm here too, I'll protect you."
    pro "Y yo también estoy aquí, te protegeré."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1268
translate spanish story_beat4_4d65bd03:

    # "He looks at me and smiles."
    "Él me mira y sonríe."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1269
translate spanish story_beat4_531cbf7d:

    # robin "Okay..."
    robin "Bueno..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1273
translate spanish story_beat4_69b537b0:

    # "Suddenly, the room goes pitch black."
    "De repente, la habitación se vuelve completamente oscura."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1276
translate spanish story_beat4_cdfdacbe:

    # "I feel Robin grab my chest and fall on top of me."
    "Siento que Robin agarra mi pecho y cae encima de mí."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1277
translate spanish story_beat4_821cd32e:

    # robin "Oh my god, the power went out!"
    robin "¡Dios mío, se fue la luz!"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1279
translate spanish story_beat4_fd08368f:

    # "He's shaking. I can feel his heart pounding against my chest."
    "Está temblando. Puedo sentir su corazón latiendo contra mi pecho."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1280
translate spanish story_beat4_8f42ae5c:

    # pro "It's okay, Robin. I'm right here."
    pro "Está bien, Robin. Estoy justo aquí."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1284
translate spanish story_beat4_3bc9df68:

    # "After a few moments, the backup generator kicks in and a dim light above the couch turns on."
    "Después de unos momentos, el generador de respaldo se activa y se enciende una luz tenue sobre el sofá."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1285
translate spanish story_beat4_7cc2e32e:

    # pro "R-robin..."
    pro "R-robin..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1286
translate spanish story_beat4_59635525:

    # "He's still gripping onto my shirt, his breathing heavy and panicked."
    "Todavía está agarrando mi camisa, su respiración es pesada y está en pánico."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1287
translate spanish story_beat4_2a21316c:

    # robin "Sorry, I just..."
    robin "Lo siento, yo solo..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1288
translate spanish story_beat4_216d290a:

    # robin "I don't like being in the dark."
    robin "No me gusta estar en la oscuridad."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1289
translate spanish story_beat4_9d1e7659:

    # pro "Hey, it's okay. You're safe, okay?"
    pro "Oye, está bien. Estás a salvo, ¿vale?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1290
translate spanish story_beat4_0fca7e6b:

    # pro "I won't let anything bad happen to you, I promise."
    pro "No dejaré que te pase nada malo, lo prometo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1291
translate spanish story_beat4_7f17a9e7:

    # "I can feel his body relaxing slowly as he gets used to the dim light."
    "Puedo sentir su cuerpo relajándose lentamente mientras se acostumbra a la tenue luz."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1292
translate spanish story_beat4_222fd6f0:

    # pro "It's okay, we just need to wait until the power comes back on."
    pro "Está bien, sólo tenemos que esperar hasta que vuelva la luz."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1293
translate spanish story_beat4_3351615d:

    # robin "S-sorry about falling on top of you like that..."
    robin "L-perdón por caer encima de ti de esa manera..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1294
translate spanish story_beat4_af94f9cb:

    # pro "No worries..."
    pro "No hay problema..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1297
translate spanish story_beat4_ec2c854c:

    # "He slowly gets off of me and sits up again."
    "Se baja lentamente de mí y se sienta de nuevo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1301
translate spanish story_beat4_294c5cbd:

    # "Robin looks so scared."
    "Robin parece muy asustado."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1302
translate spanish story_beat4_d9e308e6:

    # "His face is pale and he's shaking a little bit."
    "Su rostro está pálido y tiembla un poco."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1303
translate spanish story_beat4_fc2d0705_1:

    # pro "Hey, it's okay."
    pro "Oye, está bien."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1304
translate spanish story_beat4_7dd06f9b:

    # pro "I'm sure the power will be back on soon."
    pro "Estoy seguro de que pronto volverá la luz."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1305
translate spanish story_beat4_eac7b47a:

    # pro "And remember, I'm right here with you."
    pro "Y recuerda, estoy aquí contigo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1306
translate spanish story_beat4_052f66f1:

    # robin "It's just..."
    robin "Es solo..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1307
translate spanish story_beat4_e464d7c6:

    # robin "The knock on the door the other night... it felt like I was alone with that stalker all over again."
    robin "El golpe en la puerta la otra noche... me sentí como si estuviera sola con ese acosador otra vez."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1309
translate spanish story_beat4_8927c4a2:

    # robin "It sounds dumb, but that's how I feel..."
    robin "Suena tonto, pero así es como me siento..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1311
translate spanish story_beat4_57fb94c5:

    # pro "It's not dumb, Robin. You have every right to be scared."
    pro "No es tonto, Robin. Tienes todo el derecho a tener miedo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1312
translate spanish story_beat4_019b8370:

    # pro "That experience was really traumatic, and you're still processing it."
    pro "Esa experiencia fue realmente traumática y todavía la estás procesando."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1313
translate spanish story_beat4_7d3c9c59:

    # pro "Just know that I'm here for you, okay?"
    pro "Sólo debes saber que estoy aquí para ti, ¿de acuerdo?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1314
translate spanish story_beat4_425b462e:

    # robin "Right..."
    robin "Bien..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1315
translate spanish story_beat4_163f216b:

    # robin "What do you usually do when something scares you?"
    robin "¿Qué sueles hacer cuando algo te asusta?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1316
translate spanish story_beat4_04ef7531:

    # pro "Well, I guess I just try to distract myself."
    pro "Bueno, supongo que sólo trato de distraerme."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1317
translate spanish story_beat4_7f0e2d37:

    # pro "Watch some TV or play a video game or something."
    pro "Mira televisión o juega un videojuego o algo así."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1318
translate spanish story_beat4_61a13781:

    # robin "Those are things I can't really do right now though..."
    robin "Aunque esas son cosas que realmente no puedo hacer ahora..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1320
translate spanish story_beat4_328ae532:

    # robin "Want to just talk instead? Maybe that will help me calm down a little."
    robin "¿Quieres simplemente hablar? Quizás eso me ayude a calmarme un poco."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1322
translate spanish story_beat4_b2e7892c:

    # pro "Sure, what do you want to talk about?"
    pro "Claro, ¿de qué quieres hablar?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1323
translate spanish story_beat4_b6b06181:

    # robin "Well, we could talk about anything I guess."
    robin "Bueno, podríamos hablar de cualquier cosa, supongo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1324
translate spanish story_beat4_12dd3317:

    # pro "How about... our future plans?"
    pro "¿Qué tal... nuestros planes futuros?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1325
translate spanish story_beat4_87bb497f:

    # robin "Our future plans?"
    robin "¿Nuestros planes futuros?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1326
translate spanish story_beat4_9575172e:

    # pro "Yeah, like where we see ourselves in a year or two."
    pro "Sí, como donde nos vemos dentro de uno o dos años."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1327
translate spanish story_beat4_2f4c5d63:

    # pro "I can go first, if you want."
    pro "Puedo ir primero, si quieres."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1328
translate spanish story_beat4_531cbf7d_1:

    # robin "Okay..."
    robin "Bueno..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1329
translate spanish story_beat4_b5d3b805:

    # pro "Well, as you know, I'm an indie game developer."
    pro "Bueno, como sabes, soy un desarrollador de juegos independiente."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1330
translate spanish story_beat4_f07ef3b5:

    # pro "I'm hoping to have the first version of my project released by the end of this year."
    pro "Espero tener la primera versión de mi proyecto lanzada a finales de este año."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1331
translate spanish story_beat4_2fa922a3:

    # pro "If all goes well, I can hopefully afford to rent out a studio where I can hire a team to help me make my games!"
    pro "Si todo va bien, espero poder permitirme alquilar un estudio donde pueda contratar un equipo que me ayude a crear mis juegos."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1333
translate spanish story_beat4_4bb03c6d:

    # robin "Wow, that's really ambitious!"
    robin "¡Vaya, eso es realmente ambicioso!"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1334
translate spanish story_beat4_c2cd1b55:

    # pro "Yeah, but I've been working on this game for a long time so it's exciting to see it come to fruition."
    pro "Sí, pero he estado trabajando en este juego durante mucho tiempo, así que es emocionante verlo hecho realidad."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1335
translate spanish story_beat4_ca3b979d:

    # robin "That's so cool, I'm excited for you."
    robin "Eso es genial, estoy emocionado por ti."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1336
translate spanish story_beat4_7e4d92a1:

    # pro "Thanks. So yeah, that's what I plan on doing."
    pro "Gracias. Así que sí, eso es lo que planeo hacer."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1339
translate spanish story_beat4_b9d977a5:

    # robin "Alright, my turn."
    robin "Muy bien, mi turno."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1340
translate spanish story_beat4_d63ff168:

    # robin "Well, I'm not exactly sure how to say this but..."
    robin "Bueno, no estoy exactamente seguro de cómo decir esto pero..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1341
translate spanish story_beat4_a12a96d4:

    # pro "It's okay, take your time."
    pro "Está bien, tómate tu tiempo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1342
translate spanish story_beat4_79554dbb:

    # "I think Robin {color=#918fff}trusts{/color} me enough to confide in me."
    "Creo que Robin {color=#918fff}confía{/color} en mí lo suficiente como para confiar en mí."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1343
translate spanish story_beat4_36f9974b:

    # robin "I want to find someone..."
    robin "quiero encontrar a alguien..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1344
translate spanish story_beat4_b3ddb68b:

    # robin "Someone who will love me for me."
    robin "Alguien que me ame por mí."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1345
translate spanish story_beat4_a67d8108:

    # pro "Robin..."
    pro "Petirrojo..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1346
translate spanish story_beat4_160fe2a1:

    # robin "Maybe that's a little too far ahead for me to be thinking about, but..."
    robin "Tal vez esté demasiado lejos para pensar en ello, pero..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1347
translate spanish story_beat4_a1839a3e:

    # robin "It's always been a dream of mine to find someone, find a partner."
    robin "Siempre ha sido un sueño para mí encontrar a alguien, encontrar una pareja."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1348
translate spanish story_beat4_f205592d:

    # robin "Someone who really loves me and isn't just using me..."
    robin "Alguien que realmente me ame y no sólo me esté usando..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1349
translate spanish story_beat4_a30fb4c2:

    # robin "Since I'm a streamer, I rarely leave the house..."
    robin "Como soy streamer, rara vez salgo de casa..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1350
translate spanish story_beat4_dbc99b84:

    # robin "It's hard to meet people."
    robin "Es difícil conocer gente."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1351
translate spanish story_beat4_91ce40d6:

    # robin "Being sexualized all the time online also hasn't been good for my self-worth issues..."
    robin "Estar sexualizado todo el tiempo en línea tampoco ha sido bueno para mis problemas de autoestima..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1354
translate spanish story_beat4_a972e603:

    # robin "It comes with the job, I guess."
    robin "Supongo que viene con el trabajo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1355
translate spanish story_beat4_6ffbb649:

    # robin "But it's still hard to deal with."
    robin "Pero todavía es difícil lidiar con esto."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1356
translate spanish story_beat4_4c3c3006:

    # pro "People online are horny idiots, don't let them get to you."
    pro "Las personas en línea son idiotas cachondos, no dejes que te afecten."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1357
translate spanish story_beat4_e5bde556:

    # robin "I try not to, but it's hard."
    robin "Intento no hacerlo, pero es difícil."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1358
translate spanish story_beat4_2097a78b:

    # robin "I just want to find someone who sees me for me."
    robin "Sólo quiero encontrar a alguien que me vea por mí."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1361
translate spanish story_beat4_3e312a5b:

    # robin "I don't know... they just make me feel like I'm not worth anything."
    robin "No lo sé... simplemente me hacen sentir que no valgo nada."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1362
translate spanish story_beat4_2d902c07:

    # robin "Like I'm just a piece of meat to them."
    robin "Como si yo fuera sólo un trozo de carne para ellos."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1363
translate spanish story_beat4_606646c1:

    # pro "Wow, that's really fucked up."
    pro "Vaya, eso es realmente jodido."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1364
translate spanish story_beat4_fbe6a5e9:

    # robin "Yeah..."
    robin "Sí..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1366
translate spanish story_beat4_00875e63:

    # robin "A career on the internet has always been my dream, but now that it's become a reality..."
    robin "Una carrera en Internet siempre ha sido mi sueño, pero ahora que se ha hecho realidad..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1367
translate spanish story_beat4_e54b5eed:

    # robin "I guess I'm just kind of lost."
    robin "Supongo que estoy un poco perdido."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1368
translate spanish story_beat4_d1b429f7:

    # robin "I don't know what I want to do anymore."
    robin "Ya no sé qué quiero hacer."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1369
translate spanish story_beat4_11c213ee:

    # pro "Hey, if you ever want to talk about anything like this..."
    pro "Oye, si alguna vez quieres hablar de algo como esto..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1370
translate spanish story_beat4_1e05d98d:

    # pro "I'm always here for you, okay?"
    pro "Siempre estaré aquí para ti, ¿vale?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1371
translate spanish story_beat4_e1baa4f9:

    # robin "Th-thanks. It means a lot to me."
    robin "G-gracias. Significa mucho para mí."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1372
translate spanish story_beat4_918aae24:

    # pro "You don't need to have your entire future figured out you know..."
    pro "No necesitas tener todo tu futuro resuelto, ¿sabes?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1373
translate spanish story_beat4_a507a988:

    # pro "Sometimes things just happen unexpectedly."
    pro "A veces las cosas simplemente suceden inesperadamente."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1374
translate spanish story_beat4_e92b6384:

    # pro "Like us, we were complete strangers when you first moved in."
    pro "Al igual que nosotros, éramos completos desconocidos cuando te mudaste aquí."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1375
translate spanish story_beat4_7464c56d:

    # pro "Now, you're one of the closest friends I have."
    pro "Eres uno de los amigos más cercanos que tengo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1376
translate spanish story_beat4_68d7b9aa:

    # robin "Yeah, that's true."
    robin "Sí, eso es verdad."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1378
translate spanish story_beat4_970ac64e:

    # robin "I'm glad we became friends."
    robin "Me alegro de que nos hiciéramos amigos."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1379
translate spanish story_beat4_4a8af8d0:

    # robin "You make me feel so... comfortable."
    robin "Me haces sentir tan... cómoda."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1380
translate spanish story_beat4_e7c88bc3:

    # robin "I don't know how you do it."
    robin "No sé cómo lo haces."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1381
translate spanish story_beat4_e82f048d:

    # pro "It's a gift."
    pro "Es un regalo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1382
translate spanish story_beat4_fad03f8a:

    # "We laugh together, and for a moment the fear of the dark subsides."
    "Nos reímos juntos y por un momento el miedo a la oscuridad disminuye."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1385
translate spanish story_beat4_776782d0:

    # robin "Can I... ask you for something?"
    robin "¿Puedo... pedirte algo?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1386
translate spanish story_beat4_087f9b10:

    # pro "Of course, what is it?"
    pro "Por supuesto, ¿qué es?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1387
translate spanish story_beat4_0f0aad54:

    # robin "If you wouldn't mind, can I sleep in your room tonight?"
    robin "Si no te importa, ¿puedo dormir en tu habitación esta noche?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1388
translate spanish story_beat4_d5239721:

    # robin "If the power doesn't come back on, of course!"
    robin "¡Si no vuelve la luz, por supuesto!"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1391
translate spanish story_beat4_3fb05efa:

    # "His face flushes with embarrassment. It's adorable."
    "Su rostro se sonroja de vergüenza. Es adorable."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1392
translate spanish story_beat4_653a0356:

    # pro "Sure, you can sleep in my room with me."
    pro "Claro, puedes dormir en mi habitación conmigo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1393
translate spanish story_beat4_03b2370e:

    # robin "Are you sure it isn't weird?"
    robin "¿Estás seguro de que no es raro?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1394
translate spanish story_beat4_bf6fade1:

    # pro "Not at all!"
    pro "¡De nada!"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1395
translate spanish story_beat4_d1d174a4:

    # pro "I just want you to feel safe."
    pro "Sólo quiero que te sientas seguro."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1397
translate spanish story_beat4_c791b29e:

    # robin "Right... thank you. That means a lot to me."
    robin "Bien... gracias. Eso significa mucho para mí."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1398
translate spanish story_beat4_ff1acfe7:

    # robin "You're the best."
    robin "Usted es el mejor."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1399
translate spanish story_beat4_a6855880:

    # robin "Anyway, let's try and pass the time until the power comes back on!"
    robin "De todos modos, ¡intentemos pasar el tiempo hasta que vuelva la luz!"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1401
translate spanish story_beat4_88861444:

    # "We the next few hours the night chatting and joking around."
    "Pasamos las siguientes horas de la noche charlando y bromeando."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1402
translate spanish story_beat4_e6c427fb:

    # "I know he's still afraid, but I'm glad Robin feels comfortable enough to talk and laugh with me."
    "Sé que todavía tiene miedo, pero me alegro de que Robin se sienta lo suficientemente cómodo como para hablar y reír conmigo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1403
translate spanish story_beat4_d87aa449:

    # pro "Hey, it's starting to get really late..."
    pro "Oye, está empezando a hacerse muy tarde..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1404
translate spanish story_beat4_ae625479:

    # pro "I say we call it and head to bed, don't think the power is going to come back anytime soon."
    pro "Yo digo que lo llamemos y nos vayamos a la cama, no creo que la luz vaya a volver pronto."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1405
translate spanish story_beat4_919f61cb:

    # robin "Oh, okay..."
    robin "Ah, okey..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1406
translate spanish story_beat4_6b8abdd1:

    # robin "I guess I'm sleeping in your room tonight then, huh..."
    robin "Supongo que esta noche dormiré en tu habitación, eh..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1407
translate spanish story_beat4_a0164f5c:

    # "He seems nervous."
    "Parece nervioso."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1408
translate spanish story_beat4_74a83be0:

    # pro "If you want, I can sleep on the floor or something-"
    pro "Si quieres, puedo dormir en el suelo o algo así."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1409
translate spanish story_beat4_5f3c5ddc:

    # robin "If you don't mind... I'd actually like to sleep next to you."
    robin "Si no te importa... de hecho me gustaría dormir a tu lado."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1410
translate spanish story_beat4_153fc70a:

    # robin "Your presence is really reassuring..."
    robin "Tu presencia es realmente tranquilizadora..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1411
translate spanish story_beat4_88ba291b:

    # "I'm blushing furiously."
    "Me estoy sonrojando furiosamente."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1412
translate spanish story_beat4_2afaa221:

    # pro "Y-yeah, I can sleep next to you if you want."
    pro "S-sí, puedo dormir a tu lado si quieres."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1413
translate spanish story_beat4_93e42cf0:

    # robin "Thank you..."
    robin "Gracias..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1414
translate spanish story_beat4_5d37e9ed:

    # robin "All right then, let's go to bed."
    robin "Muy bien entonces, vámonos a la cama."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1415
