    pro "No fue mi intención... ni siquiera me di cuenta de que estaba..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3450
translate spanish ending3_443a072e:

    # pro "I blacked out and when I came to, the cops were-"
    pro "Me desmayé y cuando volví en mí, los policías estaban..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3451
translate spanish ending3_2418ba72:

    # robin "I'm leaving."
    robin "Me voy."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3453
translate spanish ending3_14e5965e:

    # robin "I'm moving out and going somewhere else."
    robin "Me voy a mudar y a ir a otro lugar."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3454
translate spanish ending3_cc59e536:

    # robin "I... I can't stay with you any more."
    robin "Yo... ya no puedo quedarme contigo."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3455
translate spanish ending3_5046e8ff:

    # robin "You broke my trust... I can't anymore."
    robin "Rompiste mi confianza... ya no puedo más."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3456
translate spanish ending3_5009e319:

    # robin "I'm sorry."
    robin "Lo lamento."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3457
translate spanish ending3_c4911750:

    # "I'm stunned. I don't know what to say."
    "Estoy atónito. No sé qué decir."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3458
translate spanish ending3_05a42722:

    # robin "I'm going to stay at a motel tonight. Don't bother trying to contact me."
    robin "Esta noche me quedaré en un motel. No te molestes en intentar contactarme."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3459
translate spanish ending3_a5c35f8d:

    # robin "I'll be back for my stuff tomorrow..."
    robin "Mañana vuelvo por mis cosas..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3460
translate spanish ending3_39e01fef:

    # robin "I can pay for the damages to the door you broke too."
    robin "Puedo pagar los daños a la puerta que rompiste también."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3461
translate spanish ending3_82353b83:

    # pro "Robin... no..."
    pro "Robin... no..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3462
translate spanish ending3_ecd229c2:

    # pro "I was... I was just..."
    pro "Yo estaba... yo solo estaba..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3464
translate spanish ending3_ed23f47e:

    # "Without another word, he turns around and leaves."
    "Sin decir más, se da vuelta y se va."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3465
translate spanish ending3_d0157b79:

    # "I'm alone... again..."
    "Estoy solo... otra vez..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3466
translate spanish ending3_f05b010b:

    # "And this time it's my fault..."
    "Y esta vez es mi culpa..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3467
translate spanish ending3_5aef4a4b:

    # "I failed him..."
    "Le fallé..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3468
translate spanish ending3_e7c39007:

    # "I told him to trust me..."
    "Le dije que confiara en mí..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3469
translate spanish ending3_050bae79:

    # "If maybe I had stayed up with him... or even just ran away with him."
    "Si tal vez me hubiera quedado despierto con él... o simplemente me hubiera escapado con él."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3470
translate spanish ending3_d3121992:

    # "This wouldn't have happened."
    "Esto no hubiera sucedido."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3472
translate spanish ending3_faa87652:

    # "I... I don't even know what to think."
    "Yo... ni siquiera sé qué pensar."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3473
translate spanish ending3_b39c2d35:

    # "What do I do now...?"
    "¿Qué hago ahora...?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3474
translate spanish ending3_52323f8f:

    # "Was this the end of things?"
    "¿Fue este el final de las cosas?"

# game/storybeat.rpy:3475
translate spanish ending3_60a1cb87:

    # "I guess so..."
    "Supongo que sí..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3476
translate spanish ending3_806de563:

    # "I'm... I'm horrible."
    "Soy... soy horrible."

# game/storybeat.rpy:3481
translate spanish ending3_db2c0ffe:

    # system "Ending 3 Complete"
    system "Finalizando 3 completo"

